## 🎨 Borders with Tailwind v4

### ⚠️ Important: Tailwind v4 Border Behavior

In Tailwind v4, the `border` class alone sets `border-width: 0px`. To make borders visible, you need to explicitly set the width.

### ✅ Correct Border Pattern

**Use inline `style={{ border: "..." }}` with design system colors:**

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Simple border with design system color
<div className="bg-card rounded-lg p-6" style={{ border: "1px solid var(--border)" }}>
  Content with visible 1px border
</div>

// ✅ CORRECT - Different border widths (replaces border-2, border-4, etc.)
<div style={{ border: "1px solid var(--border)" }}>1px border</div>
<div style={{ border: "2px solid var(--border)" }}>2px border</div>
<div style={{ border: "4px solid var(--border)" }}>4px border</div>

// ✅ CORRECT - Different border styles
<div style={{ border: "2px dashed var(--border)" }}>Dashed border</div>
<div style={{ border: "1px dotted var(--border)" }}>Dotted border</div>

// ✅ CORRECT - Different sides
<div style={{ borderTop: "2px solid var(--border)" }}>Top border only</div>
<div style={{ borderBottom: "1px solid var(--border)" }}>Bottom border only</div>
```

### ❌ Wrong Border Patterns

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Tailwind border classes don't work reliably in v4
<div className="border border-border">
  No visible border! (border-width is 0px by default)
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - border-2, border-4 don't work in Tailwind v4
<div className="border-2 border-border">
  Still no visible border!
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Common violation: border-border pattern
<div className="bg-card border border-border rounded-lg">
  This is a common violation that should be fixed!
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Complex inline style objects for borders
<div
  style={{
    borderWidth: "1px",
    borderStyle: "solid",
    borderColor: "var(--border)"
  }}
>
  Unnecessarily verbose
</div>
```

### 📋 Border Best Practices

1. **Always use `style={{ border: "..." }}`** for all borders
2. **Use design system colors** like `var(--border)`, `var(--input)`, `var(--ring)`
3. **Keep it simple** - one `border` property instead of separate width/style/color
4. **Use Tailwind for everything else** - spacing, layout, colors, but NOT borders

### 🚨 Common Border Violations to Fix

**❌ NEVER use these patterns:**

```tsx
// ❌ VIOLATION - border-border pattern
